abstract: 
  This repository discloses the methods, algorithms, and concepts of Space Socks: A Quantum Entanglement Game.
  It was published as a defensive publication to establish prior art and timestamp the
  innovative ideas presented. The work aims to support open science and prevent
  patenting of fundamental concepts in quantum simulation and gamified education and 
  innovative teaching methods remain accessible to the broader scientific and educational communities.
